{"seq":2,"slug":"react-server-components","title":"React Server Components 服务端组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/server-rendering/react-server-components","wordCount":615,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"react-server-components-服务端组件\">React Server Components 服务端组件</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>React Server Components（RSC）是一类只在服务器上执行、不会被发送到客户端的组件。它们可以直接访问数据库与文件系统，其代码也不进入客户端 JS bundle，因此能显著减小体积。与此同时，<code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 划分出客户端边界，跨越边界的 props 必须可序列化。本章讲解 RSC 的价值、Server/Client 边界、async 组件与并行数据获取、序列化限制，以及它与传统 SSR 的关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rsc-的革命性\">RSC 的革命性</h2><p><strong>React Server Components（RSC）</strong> 是一种全新的组件类型，它在服务器上执行并且不会发送到客户端。RSC 可以直接访问数据库、文件系统等服务端资源，且其代码不包含在客户端 JS bundle 中。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 服务端&#10;        A[&quot;Server Component&quot;]&#10;        A --&gt; B[直接读取数据库]&#10;        A --&gt; C[访问文件系统]&#10;        A --&gt; D[调用内部 API]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 客户端&#10;        E[&quot;Client Component&quot;]&#10;        E --&gt; F[&quot;useState / useEffect&quot;]&#10;        E --&gt; G[事件处理]&#10;        E --&gt; H[浏览器 API]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt;|序列化结果| E\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 服务端\n        A[\"Server Component\"]\n        A --&gt; B[直接读取数据库]\n        A --&gt; C[访问文件系统]\n        A --&gt; D[调用内部 API]\n    end\n    subgraph 客户端\n        E[\"Client Component\"]\n        E --&gt; F[\"useState / useEffect\"]\n        E --&gt; G[事件处理]\n        E --&gt; H[浏览器 API]\n    end\n    A --&gt;|序列化结果| E</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Server Component</th>\n<th>Client Component</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>运行环境</td>\n<td>仅服务器</td>\n<td>服务器 + 客户端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包含在 JS Bundle</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访问数据库</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用 Hooks</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用事件处理</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>async/await</td>\n<td>✅（组件本身）</td>\n<td>❌（组件本身）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认类型</td>\n<td>✅（默认）</td>\n<td>需要 <code>&#39;use client&#39;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"server-client-边界\">Server/Client 边界</h2><p>通过 <code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 指令标记客户端组件。没有该指令的组件默认为 Server Component：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// ServerComponent.tsx — 服务器组件（默认）&#10;import { db } from &#39;@/lib/db&#39;;&#10;&#10;async function ArticleList() {&#10;  const articles = await db.article.findMany({&#10;    orderBy: { createdAt: &#39;desc&#39; },&#10;    take: 10,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;ul&gt;&#10;      {articles.map((article) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;li key={article.id}&gt;&#10;          &lt;ArticleCard article={article} /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/li&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// ServerComponent.tsx — 服务器组件（默认）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { db } from '@/lib/db';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async function ArticleList() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const articles = await db.article.findMany({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    orderBy: { createdAt: 'desc' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    take: 10,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {articles.map((article) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;li key={article.id}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;ArticleCard article={article} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// LikeButton.tsx — 客户端组件&#10;&#39;use client&#39;;&#10;&#10;import { useState } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;export function LikeButton({ articleId }: { articleId: string }) {&#10;  const [liked, setLiked] = useState(false);&#10;&#10;  return &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; setLiked(!liked)}&gt;{liked ? &#39;❤️&#39; : &#39;🤍&#39;} 喜欢&lt;/button&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// LikeButton.tsx — 客户端组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>'use client';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { useState } from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export function LikeButton({ articleId }: { articleId: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [liked, setLiked] = useState(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;button onClick={() => setLiked(!liked)}>{liked ? '❤️' : '🤍'} 喜欢&#x3C;/button>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Page (Server)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B[&quot;Header (Server)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;ArticleList (Server)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Footer (Server)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;ArticleCard (Server)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;LikeButton (Client)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;ShareMenu (Client)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; H[&quot;SearchBar (Client)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Page (Server)\"]\n    A --&gt; B[\"Header (Server)\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"ArticleList (Server)\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Footer (Server)\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"ArticleCard (Server)\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"LikeButton (Client)\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"ShareMenu (Client)\"]\n    B --&gt; H[\"SearchBar (Client)\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 标记的不是单个组件，而是一个<strong>边界</strong>。从该文件导入的所有组件及其子组件都将成为客户端组件。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"async-components\">Async Components</h2><p>Server Components 可以是 async 函数，直接在组件体内 await 数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"async function UserProfile({ userId }: { userId: string }) {&#10;  const user = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/users/${userId}`).then((res) =&gt; res.json());&#10;&#10;  const posts = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/users/${userId}/posts`).then((res) =&gt; res.json());&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;h1&gt;{user.name}&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;      &lt;p&gt;{user.bio}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;      &lt;h2&gt;文章列表&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;      &lt;ul&gt;&#10;        {posts.map((post: { id: string; title: string }) =&gt; (&#10;          &lt;li key={post.id}&gt;{post.title}&lt;/li&gt;&#10;        ))}&#10;      &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function ProfilePage({ userId }: { userId: string }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;ProfileSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;      &lt;UserProfile userId={userId} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async function UserProfile({ userId }: { userId: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const user = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/users/${userId}`).then((res) => res.json());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const posts = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/users/${userId}/posts`).then((res) => res.json());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;h1>{user.name}&#x3C;/h1></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;p>{user.bio}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;h2>文章列表&#x3C;/h2></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {posts.map((post: { id: string; title: string }) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;li key={post.id}>{post.title}&#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function ProfilePage({ userId }: { userId: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;ProfileSkeleton />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;UserProfile userId={userId} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"并行数据获取\">并行数据获取</h3><p>避免瀑布式请求，使用 <code>Promise.all</code> 并行获取：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"async function Dashboard() {&#10;  const [user, stats, notifications] = await Promise.all([fetchUser(), fetchStats(), fetchNotifications()]);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;UserInfo user={user} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;StatsPanel stats={stats} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;NotificationList notifications={notifications} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async function Dashboard() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [user, stats, notifications] = await Promise.all([fetchUser(), fetchStats(), fetchNotifications()]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;UserInfo user={user} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;StatsPanel stats={stats} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;NotificationList notifications={notifications} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"序列化\">序列化</h2><p>Server Component 的渲染结果通过特殊的序列化协议（RSC Payload）传输到客户端。传递给 Client Component 的 props 必须是可序列化的：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可序列化</th>\n<th>不可序列化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>string, number, boolean</td>\n<td>函数（Function）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>null, undefined</td>\n<td>类实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Date</td>\n<td>Symbol</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数组、普通对象</td>\n<td>Map, Set（需要转换）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>React 元素</td>\n<td>DOM 节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Server Action（引用）</td>\n<td>闭包</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// ✅ 正确：传递可序列化的数据&#10;async function ParentServer() {&#10;  const data = await fetchData();&#10;&#10;  return &lt;ClientChild title={data.title} count={data.count} items={data.items} /&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ❌ 错误：不能传递函数&#10;async function ParentServer() {&#10;  const handleClick = () =&gt; console.log(&#39;clicked&#39;);&#10;  return &lt;ClientChild onClick={handleClick} /&gt;; // 报错&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ✅ 使用 Server Action 替代&#10;async function ParentServer() {&#10;  async function handleSubmit(formData: FormData) {&#10;    &#39;use server&#39;;&#10;    await db.article.create({&#10;      data: { title: formData.get(&#39;title&#39;) as string },&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return &lt;ClientForm action={handleSubmit} /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 正确：传递可序列化的数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async function ParentServer() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const data = await fetchData();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;ClientChild title={data.title} count={data.count} items={data.items} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 错误：不能传递函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async function ParentServer() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const handleClick = () => console.log('clicked');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;ClientChild onClick={handleClick} />; // 报错</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 使用 Server Action 替代</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async function ParentServer() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  async function handleSubmit(formData: FormData) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    'use server';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await db.article.create({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      data: { title: formData.get('title') as string },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;ClientForm action={handleSubmit} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[Server Component 渲染] --&gt; B[生成 RSC Payload]&#10;    B --&gt; C[序列化: JSON + 特殊标记]&#10;    C --&gt; D[传输到客户端]&#10;    D --&gt; E[客户端反序列化]&#10;    E --&gt; F[与 Client Component 树合并]&#10;    F --&gt; G[渲染到 DOM]\">flowchart LR\n    A[Server Component 渲染] --&gt; B[生成 RSC Payload]\n    B --&gt; C[序列化: JSON + 特殊标记]\n    C --&gt; D[传输到客户端]\n    D --&gt; E[客户端反序列化]\n    E --&gt; F[与 Client Component 树合并]\n    F --&gt; G[渲染到 DOM]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"server-components-的优势\">Server Components 的优势</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// 零 Bundle 影响的重依赖&#10;import { marked } from &#39;marked&#39;;&#10;import hljs from &#39;highlight.js&#39;;&#10;import sanitizeHtml from &#39;sanitize-html&#39;;&#10;&#10;async function MarkdownArticle({ slug }: { slug: string }) {&#10;  const article = await db.article.findUnique({ where: { slug } });&#10;  if (!article) return notFound();&#10;&#10;  const html = sanitizeHtml(&#10;    marked(article.content, {&#10;      highlight: (code, lang) =&gt; hljs.highlight(code, { language: lang }).value,&#10;    }),&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  return &lt;article dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: html }} /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 零 Bundle 影响的重依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { marked } from 'marked';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import hljs from 'highlight.js';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import sanitizeHtml from 'sanitize-html';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async function MarkdownArticle({ slug }: { slug: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const article = await db.article.findUnique({ where: { slug } });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (!article) return notFound();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const html = sanitizeHtml(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    marked(article.content, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      highlight: (code, lang) => hljs.highlight(code, { language: lang }).value,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;article dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: html }} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>marked</code>、<code>highlight.js</code>、<code>sanitize-html</code> 这些库只在服务端使用，不会打包到客户端，节省数百 KB 的 bundle 体积。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>RSC</strong> 在服务器上运行，不包含在客户端 JS bundle 中，可直接访问服务端资源</li>\n<li><code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 标记客户端边界，从该文件开始的所有子组件都是客户端组件</li>\n<li>Server Components 支持 <strong>async/await</strong>，可直接在组件体内获取数据</li>\n<li>传递给 Client Component 的 props 必须<strong>可序列化</strong>，函数使用 Server Action 替代</li>\n<li>重依赖（Markdown 解析、语法高亮等）放在 Server Component 中可以显著减小 bundle 体积</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"React Server Components 服务端组件","id":"react-server-components-服务端组件"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"RSC 的革命性","id":"rsc-的革命性"},{"level":2,"text":"Server/Client 边界","id":"server-client-边界"},{"level":2,"text":"Async Components","id":"async-components"},{"level":3,"text":"并行数据获取","id":"并行数据获取"},{"level":2,"text":"序列化","id":"序列化"},{"level":2,"text":"Server Components 的优势","id":"server-components-的优势"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SSR 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/server-rendering/ssr-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"Next.js App Router 应用路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/server-rendering/nextjs-app-router"}}